# One account. App-leg phones register over TLS to the light server with no
# Digest password (transport-authenticated app leg; auth_pass is a
# placeholder). A desk phone registers over UDP to the harness PBX with the
# PBX's Digest credentials (AUTH_USER/AUTH_PASS) and G.711 only, like a
# real desk phone.
# @REGINT@ is the registration interval; 0 = start unregistered (the wake test
# registers on demand via ctrl_tcp, as the woken app would).
# @OUTBOUND@ (optional) is an outbound proxy by address, like a real phone
# uses; libre resolves the AOR domain by DNS only (never /etc/hosts).
<sip:@SIP_USER@@@SIP_DOMAIN@;transport=@TRANSPORT@>;auth_user=@AUTH_USER@;auth_pass=@AUTH_PASS@;regint=@REGINT@;answermode=auto;audio_codecs=@CODECS@@OUTBOUND@
